{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 01 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CNN 主干：从大规模分类到现代卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN Backbones</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_085_efficientnet-title\">EfficientNet</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以 NAS 设计的 MBConv+SE 基线配合 depth/width/resolution 三维 compound scaling。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">NAS-discovered MBConv+SE baseline scaled jointly across depth, width, and input resolution via a compound coefficient φ.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">2D 图像与缩放系数 phi</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image scaled according to compound coefficient φ</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">效率优化的分类 logits 或层级特征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Compute-efficient classification logits or multi-scale feature pyramid</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Table 1 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构表</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v97/tan19a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_085_efficientnet')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_085_efficientnet')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"EfficientNet original paper architecture figure, Table 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/bd372ed165307e223e7a.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Table 1 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_085_efficientnet\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_085_efficientnet')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_085_efficientnet\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">复合缩放</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Compound Scaling</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">depth=alpha^phi、width=beta^phi、resolution=gamma^phi，并满足近似计算约束</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image scaled according to compound coefficient φ and prepares initial tensor representations (Compound Scaling).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"depth=alpha^phi、width=beta^phi、resolution=gamma^phi，并满足近似计算约束\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d image scaled according to compound coefficient φ and prepares initial tensor representations (Compound Scaling).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"复合缩放\" data-node-name-en=\"Compound Scaling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">复合缩放</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Compound Scaling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">depth=alpha^phi、width=beta^phi、resolution=gamma^phi，并满足近似计算约束</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image scaled according to compound coefficient φ and prepares initial tensor representations (Compound Scaling).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"分辨率随 B0→B7 同步扩大\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Input Image to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">分辨率随 B0→B7 同步扩大</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Input Image to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3×3 stride-2 Conv 建立浅层特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Convolutional Stem within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"卷积 Stem\" data-node-name-en=\"Convolutional Stem\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">卷积 Stem</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Convolutional Stem</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3×3 stride-2 Conv 建立浅层特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Convolutional Stem within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"前一 MBConv 的输出；identity shortcut 从这里绕过主变换\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Block input within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Block 输入\" data-node-name-en=\"Block input\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Block 输入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Block input</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">前一 MBConv 的输出；identity shortcut 从这里绕过主变换</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Block input within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1 expansion 形成高维 inverted bottleneck；首类 MBConv1 可不扩维\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs MBConv within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"MBConv 扩维\" data-node-name-en=\"MBConv\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">MBConv 扩维</span><span class=\"lang-en\">MBConv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1 expansion 形成高维 inverted bottleneck；首类 MBConv1 可不扩维</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs MBConv within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3×3/5×5 逐通道空间卷积，stride 控制 stage 下采样\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Depthwise Conv within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Depthwise Conv\" data-node-name-en=\"Depthwise Conv\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Depthwise Conv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3×3/5×5 逐通道空间卷积，stride 控制 stage 下采样</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Depthwise Conv within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"global pooling 与小 MLP 对 expanded channels 重标定\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SE within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"SE 门控\" data-node-name-en=\"SE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">SE 门控</span><span class=\"lang-en\">SE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">global pooling 与小 MLP 对 expanded channels 重标定</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SE within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1 project 回低维；尺寸相同时接 identity skip 与 stochastic depth\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"线性投影\" data-node-name-en=\"projection\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">线性投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1 project 回低维；尺寸相同时接 identity skip 与 stochastic depth</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection within the core compound scaled mbconv cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按搜索得到的 kernel、扩张率、通道和重复数堆叠 MBConv\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies NAS-B0 Stages to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"NAS-B0 Stages\" data-node-name-en=\"NAS-B0 Stages\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>NAS-B0 Stages</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按搜索得到的 kernel、扩张率、通道和重复数堆叠 MBConv</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies NAS-B0 Stages to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1 head、global average pooling、dropout 与 FC\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces compute-efficient classification logits or multi-scale feature pyramid via GAP.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"GAP 分类头\" data-node-name-en=\"GAP\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_085_efficientnet', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">GAP 分类头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">GAP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1 head、global average pooling、dropout 与 FC</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces compute-efficient classification logits or multi-scale feature pyramid via GAP.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"EfficientNet Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 深度、宽度与分辨率的复合缩放律</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Principled Compound Scaling of Depth, Width, and Resolution</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"EfficientNet：核心公式 · 深度、宽度与分辨率的复合缩放律\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"85\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.06712pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.613269 -69.000129 230.239743 11.06712\" width=\"230.239743pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.697191-3.106656V-3.305165L.615376-5.697191V-5.131442L4.744351-3.195985L.615376-1.260528V-.704705L5.697191-3.106656ZM5.697191 .575674V.049627H.615376V.575674H5.697191Z\" id=\"m085_g4-21\"></path><path d=\"M5.766669-4.258005L5.56816-4.347334C5.409354-3.77166 5.101666-3.265463 4.446588-3.265463C3.672405-3.265463 3.017328-4.357259 2.12404-4.357259C1.260528-4.357259 .803959-3.831212 .575674-3.037178L.774183-2.957775C.992542-3.473897 1.349857-3.841137 1.935457-3.841137C2.70964-3.841137 3.285314-2.759267 4.24808-2.759267C5.20092-2.759267 5.627713-3.374643 5.766669-4.258005ZM5.756743-2.233219L5.558235-2.332474C5.399428-1.756799 5.09174-1.250603 4.436663-1.250603C3.66248-1.250603 3.007402-2.342399 2.114114-2.342399C1.250603-2.342399 .784108-1.816352 .555824-1.022318L.764257-.942915C.982617-1.45903