0702-.123175L2.941697-2.956188C3.514096-2.775049 3.637271-2.347561 3.637271-2.166422ZM2.434508-2.977925L1.68097-.137666C1.152044-.275331 .956414-.71731 .956414-1.021624C.956414-2.13744 1.61576-2.876487 2.434508-2.977925Z\" id=\"m085_g7-113\"></path><use id=\"m085_g17-49\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g14-49\"></use><use id=\"m085_g17-50\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g14-50\"></use></defs><g id=\"m085_page1\"><use x=\"-68.76215\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-51\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"-60.49544\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g1-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"-51.322133\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-85\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"-44.520643\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g7-113\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"-39.200707\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"-24.847923\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-70\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"-14.987183\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g1-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"-5.335666\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-86\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\".589099\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g7-113\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"5.909035\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"19.972909\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-65\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"27.362897\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g1-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"36.605941\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-87\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"42.869444\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g7-113\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"48.18938\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"62.482393\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-85\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"69.177284\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-86\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"74.447503\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g14-50\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"78.721469\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-87\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"84.330425\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g14-50\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"91.232247\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g4-25\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"100.335815\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g17-50\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"105.317135\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"119.610147\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-85\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"125.757091\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"130.565673\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-86\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"135.835891\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"140.236002\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g10-87\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"148.61229\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g4-21\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"157.715858\" xlink:href=\"#m085_g17-49\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">任意单独加深、加宽或提高分辨率常造成计算失衡</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Scaling network depth, width, or image resolution in isolation rapidly saturates accuracy and wastes FLOPs.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用复合系数联合缩放网络深度、宽度和输入分辨率</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Couple depth (α^φ), width (β^φ), and resolution (γ^φ) under a unified compound scaling constraint.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以 NAS 获得 B0 基线，并系统研究、经验确定 compound scaling 系数</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Combines MobileInvertedBottleneck (MBConv + SE) with empirically calibrated compound scaling laws.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">后续被用于算力受限的医学分类、超声和移动端筛查</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Widely deployed in resource-constrained 2D medical classification, point-of-care ultrasound, and dermatology/fundus screening.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">仍是效率基线；高分辨率 3D 医学任务的内存瓶颈需另行处理</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Strong 2D efficiency baseline; depthwise separable kernels and high resolution require separate activation-memory audits in 3D.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">先以 NAS 得到 EfficientNet-B0，再用单一 phi 协调深度、宽度和输入分辨率，而非只放大一维。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">MBConv 以 expansion、depthwise spatial filtering、SE 与线性 projection 获得较高计算效率。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">compound coefficients 是经验/搜索确定的缩放规律，不保证直接迁移到 3D 体数据。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Couple depth (α^φ), width (β^φ), and resolution (γ^φ) under a unified compound scaling constraint.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Combines MobileInvertedBottleneck (MBConv + SE) with empirically calibrated compound scaling laws.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Principled Compound Scaling of Depth, Width, and Resolution.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合作为超声、X-ray、皮肤图像及移动筛查的参数/算力效率基线。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">在高分辨率 3D CT/MRI 中，体素数主导内存，2D compound scaling 需重新设计而非机械套用。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Widely deployed in resource-constrained 2D medical classification, point-of-care ultrasound, and dermatology/fundus screening.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Strong 2D efficiency baseline; depthwise separable kernels and high resolution require separate activation-memory audits in 3D.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v97/tan19a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>EfficientNet: Rethinking Model Scaling for Convolutional Neural Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/tensorflow/tpu/tree/master/models/official/efficientnet\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
